      <link>https://status.cloud.microsoft/exchange-online-advisory</link>
      <title>Exchange Online - Intermittent Send Delays in Australia</title>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;Engineers are investigating reports of intermittent email send delays affecting Exchange Online users in Australia and APAC regions. Impact appears to be on outbound message submission only.&lt;/div&gt;</description>
